#. Wardrobe: how rare a look is, as in collectible games
msgid "COMMON"
msgstr "COMUM"

#. Wardrobe: how rare a look is, as in collectible games
msgid "UNCOMMON"
msgstr "INCOMUM"

#. Wardrobe: how rare a look is, as in collectible games
msgid "RARE"
msgstr "RARO"

#. Wardrobe: how rare a look is, as in collectible games
msgid "EPIC"
msgstr "ÉPICO"

#. Wardrobe: how rare a look is, as in collectible games
